sentences.text:
Miscellaneous First Appeal No.101238 of 2020 preferred by the Insurance is dismissed;
2. Miscellaneous First Appeal No.101286 of 2020 preferred by the claimants is allowed in part;
3. Judgment and award dated 01st February, 2020 passed in MVC No. 2307 of 2018 by the X Additional District Judge and Member, Motor Accident Claims Tribunal,
Belagavi is modified holding that claimants are entitled for total compensation of Smt.Meenaxi W/O Sanjeev @ Sanju ... vs Shri.Mahantesh S/O Siddappa Valadavar on 17 August, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/97444273/
6 Rs.20,61,668/-
as against Rs.17,83,600/- awarded by the Tribunal with interest at the rate of 6% per annum from the date of petition till the date of realisation.

